#: main.py:56
msgid "Enter your name, brave adventurer: "
msgstr ""

#: main.py:117
msgid ""
"You are at the beginning of your adventure. There's a path leading north "
"towards a town, and another path leading east towards a forest."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:121
msgid "You cheat and get a sword. You feel guilty"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:125
msgid ""
"You are in a dark forest. The trees are tall and the air is thick, you can "
"make out a faint trail heading further east."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:132
msgid ""
"You enter a dark cave at the end of the trail. The air is cold and damp. You "
"see a faint light at the end of the cave."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:139
msgid ""
"You find a treasure chest at the end of the cave. Inside is a small "
"decorative wooden box with no visible way of opening it."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:141
msgid "You take the box and place it in your pocket."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:142
msgid ""
"You retrace your steps and go back to where you first started your adventure"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:146
msgid "You are at the blacksmith's forge. The blacksmith is busy working."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:149
msgid "You ask the blacksmith to forge you a new sword."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:154
msgid "You pour water on the forge. The coals sizzle."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:159
msgid "You add more coal to the forge, increasing its heat."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:164
msgid "You check if the sword is ready."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:173
msgid ""
"You are in a bustling town. People are going about their business. You see a "
"blacksmith, a mysterious man wandering the streets, a quest giver, and a "
"chapel."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:176
msgid "You help the town rebuild the blacksmith."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:184
msgid "You meet a mysterious man. He offers to enhance your sword with magic."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:186
msgid "A great choice indeed. Your sword is now enchanted with great power."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:187
msgid "You will not get another chance. ACCEPT MY OFFER!"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:192
msgid "You meet a wizard. He yells 'Are you here to kill me?!'"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:194
msgid "You attempt to kill the wizard."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:199
msgid ""
"You meet a quest giver. He offers you a quest to defeat the evil wizard."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:201
msgid "You tell the quest giver you would like to accept..."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:206
msgid "You enter the chapel. The priest greets you warmly."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:208
msgid "The priest looks at your sword"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:209
msgid "You pray for guidance."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:217
msgid "You already have the box."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:220
msgid "You hear a slight hum coming from the box as you touch it."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:227
msgid ""
"As you enter the blacksmith you trip over a small stone slab. You feel "
"lighter somehow."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:237
msgid ""
"While rebuilding the blacksmith, amongst the ashes you find the burnt "
"remains of the decorative box. Laying beside it is a glowing, unburnt, piece "
"of parchment which reads: 'Congratulations, Adventurer!'. Below it is a long "
"cryptic looking message."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:242
msgid "You help the town rebuild the blacksmith. The blacksmith is grateful."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:294
msgid ""
"You throw a bucket of water over the forge. The coals sizzle and the forge "
"cools down completely."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:298
msgid ""
"You fire up the forge and it begins heating up. You should wait a while "
"before checking on the sword."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:302
msgid "You already have a sword. You don't need another one."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:307
msgid "You requested another sword, but the forge is still hot!"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:308
msgid ""
"The blacksmith looks at you with disappointment. He says, 'Fine, but be more "
"careful this time! If the forge gets too hot, the sword will melt.'"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:310 main.py:311
msgid ""
"The blacksmith refuses to forge you another sword. You have wasted too much "
"of his time."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:314
msgid ""
"The blacksmith agrees to forge you a sword. It will take some time and the "
"forge needs to be heated to the correct temperature however."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:331
msgid "You should continue north you cheater."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:339
msgid ""
"You strike the wizard down with your holy sword. The town cheers for you. "
"Your adventure has come to an end."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:344
msgid ""
"Your sword falters as you try to strike the wizard down. The wizard laughs "
"as you fall to the ground."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:345
msgid ""
"The wizard laughs as you strike him down. The sword was cursed. You have "
"failed. The adventure ends here."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:349
msgid ""
"Your sword is not powerful enough to defeat the wizard. Your sword shatters, "
"you should probably get a new one."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:351
msgid ""
"You try to strike the wizard down but your sword is not powerful enough."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:356
msgid "I have already blessed your sword child, go now and use it well."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:369
msgid "The priest blesses your sword. You feel a warm glow."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:381
msgid ""
"The priest transfers the curse from the sword to himself. He falls to the "
"ground."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:382
msgid "The sword is now blessed. You feel a warm glow."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:383
msgid ""
"The priest looks at your sword with fear. My child, this sword is cursed. I "
"will transfer the curse to me."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:385
msgid "The priest looks at your empty hands. You feel a little embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:396
msgid "Sword forged"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:397
msgid "The sword is ready. You take it from the blacksmith."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:401
msgid "The sword has completely melted!"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:402
msgid ""
"The sword has completely melted! The blacksmith looks at you with "
"disappointment."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:404
msgid "To cold!"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:405
msgid "The forge is not hot enough yet. The blacksmith tells you to wait."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:421
msgid ""
"The evil wizard has enchanted your sword with dark magic. You feel a chill "
"run down your spine. This is a warning..."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:422
msgid "You feel funny but powerful. Maybe I should accept a quest."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:427
msgid "You killed the quest giver with your evil sword!"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:428
msgid ""
"The sword whispers; I killed them! you will never destroy the wizard with me "
"in your hands! Hahahaha"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:430
msgid "The quest giver turns pale. They collapse. Dead! What do I do now?"
msgstr ""

#: main.py:432
msgid ""
"The sword whispers; I will help you defeat the wizard. I am your only hope."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:434
msgid ""
"Wow! You have such a powerful sword. I will give you a quest to defeat the "
"evil wizard."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:437
msgid "He's not really impressed with your sword."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:438
msgid ""
"Ok, if you're sure... But it seems your sword may not be powerful enough to "
"defeat the wizard."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:439
msgid ""
"The quest giver tentatively gives you a quest to defeat the evil wizard."
msgstr ""

#: main.py:441
msgid ""
"You don't have a sword. The quest giver looks at you with disappointment."
msgstr ""

